{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_02",
  "title": "But Only Farewell",
  "storyCode": "EA-2",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4bcdeea72e066b0291f1016914363ec12c9f1a5e9072ba5bc2254cb8aeee97d7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wow. There are so many people here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry. Please make way—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Aah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Impatient Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've been to Millington Street already. It was picked clean ages ago! The shops are still open, but the shelves are all empty! Even the shopping bags are gone!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Impatient Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kraman said they had stuff left here, so I ran five blocks only to find not even a single fowlbeast feather left!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Impatient Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Might as well go back, grab my crossbow, and sneak past the guards to hunt in the Dark Woods—at least I might get some real meat before I starve."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've really gone crazy from hunger now—going into the forest is a death wish!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Impatient Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And you're <i>not</i> crazy? Stop talking like you know anything!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who are you to say I don't know anything? The grain store on Lagran Street, Emma's place, you know about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Impatient Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Haven't had a chance to check it out yet. What of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I went there and had a look. There's no grain left, but from what Emma says, it's all because of those bloody Victorians!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Impatient Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Victorian bastards have been blockading us since forever. This isn't new, so why act like it's a big shock?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Because their spies have already infiltrated Na Saoirsí!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Impatient Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When Emma went to visit the ag plate, she saw the charred remains with her own eyes. Dublinn is still investigating!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Impatient Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Bloody hell! We should've struck back the minute Tara gained independence!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're right about one thing though: you should go get your crossbow. Not to hunt, but to root out the traitors!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course, if <i>I</i> caught them, I wouldn't let them off that easy. A quick death is too good for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(*Whispers*) I guess the stores have been cut off from the supply of grain..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(*Whispers*) I boiled a few potatoes for Culann, but is it enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(*Whispers*) There are too many people here. I'll take another route."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(*Whispers*) Lots of them are armed too..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(*Whispers*) Are they planning to hunt down Victorian spies? But there's no grain left in the city... what does that have to do with the Victorians?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(*Whispers*) But I...."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(*Whispers*) I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll be fine. I'm Mr. Culann's apprentice—everyone knows that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't be afraid, Theo. No one will hurt you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Theo crouches down and squeezes through the crowd, making his way to the opposite corner of the street. He nimbly slips through a dark, narrow passage and emerges on the other side of a brick wall.\nThe noise of the crowd gradually fades from his ears."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "....See? No one gave me any trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mr. Culann must still be busy with the dragon sculpture. By the time he notices what's going on around him, all the stores will be empty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theo",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I need to help him."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Take these and give them to the neighbors. Tell them not to worry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What about you? Or Nemos? Will she have anything to eat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Instead of giving us grain, it'd be more useful to help everyone catch the spies. Otherwise, we'll never get to the root of the problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "...I'll go. Please let everyone know.\nBut for now, just take them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nemos stands with The Leader, so it's only natural to endure a little hardship for everyone's sake."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Alright then. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Brooding Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey Culann, you must have more where that came from, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Brooding Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Besides, how'd you know we'd be running out of grains? Did Nemos tip you off in advance, or...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you saying, Rory?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you don't want any, fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Brooding Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How do I know you or Nemos aren't spies? You've both been raising that Victorian boy together!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Get out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Brooding Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What, did I hit a nerve? Am I right? Are you really—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Culann! I heard you've been distributing grain! Impeccable timing! So where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everything that's left is right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Brooding Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't change the subject. You still haven't answered me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've said everything I had to say. If you feel these potatoes will dirty your hands, then give them to someone else."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Brooding Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why you—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you want them or not, Rory? If not, then let me have them. There are plenty of hungry bellies to feed. Don't be ungrateful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now give them here—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Brooding Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why should I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't want them, right? So give them to me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Brooding Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fat chance!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ugh—Aaahh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The potatoes in the bag were very small. None had the usual oval shape."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My arm!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My God! He's bleeding! How could you turn a blade on a fellow Taran, Rory?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Brooding Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I, I—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Drop the sword."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't make me use my hammer on you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Y-You're the only one we can count on, Culann."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Something's been off about Rory lately, I'll follow him a bit, to check up on him. He's been out of sorts ever since his antique collection got burned in the war."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As for his blade, just take it. Don't let him have it back."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Culann... I... Ughh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The wound isn't too deep. Come here, I'll stop the bleeding. As far as the grains, I'll have Nemos think of a solution when she gets back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know... ow ow ow... I know. You're giving away everything you have."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But you know, you're not as scary as you look—\nOw!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't talk. Save your energy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I might have some cornmeal left at home. Let me check."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can have it, then I'll walk you home."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nemos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Culann! Are you and Theo doing alright—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nemos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Why is there blood in here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rory lost control and slashed someone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nemos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where's Theo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He left a while ago for—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dammit!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You—\n*Sigh* Forget it. No one could have foreseen things getting so bad, so quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How are things in the city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nemos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rumors are spreading everywhere that the Victorians destroyed the ag plate, and Na Saoirsí is about to boil over."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nemos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know no one dared to go after Theo after you stood up for him, so you felt safe letting him run around. But this time... it's different."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have to go find him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nemos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you have time for that? Aren't you making that statue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It only needs to be finished before Samhain. There's still a little time left...\nDammit! Dammit!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nemos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll worry about Theo. You just focus on your work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Culann",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nemos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you seen Theo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Theo? Where has that boy run off to... Slacking off again, no doubt. Culann spoils him too much. You really should talk to him about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nemos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Theo, Theo!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indifferent Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What trouble has that boy gotten himself into <i>this</i> time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nemos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you seen Theo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
