    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Singer'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Also, the information you've provided us on the wakemen has been truly fascinating—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nemos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ah, sorry sir, but I really don't have time to be reminiscing. But I could use your assistance. Culann's apprentice, Theo, has gone missing. Can you help me look for him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Singer'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I am... unable to help with that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Singer'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The cityfolk are angry enough at the Victorians to flay one alive. Why bother running around looking for a Victorian child?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nemos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Forget it then. I'll go look myself."
